  "content": "<h1>暗潮</h1><p><strong>描述</strong></p><p>在副手裝備鑽石鏟，你就能像美人魚一樣游泳！</p><p><em>支援伺服器端。你可以只在伺服器安裝，客戶端無需安裝。</em></p><p>由《<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">黑暗RPG</a>》的製作團隊打造（想體驗完整RPG內容？請下載 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG 模組包</a>，享受任務與RPG玩法）</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>特色</h2><p>（這些功能將進一步提升您的原版遊戲體驗）</p><p>在副手欄放置水桶，並使用指令 <strong>/trigger breathe</strong>，即可獲得水下呼吸、夜視和快速游泳狀態效果。</p><p>效果持續5分鐘，並可再次啟動。</p><h2>起源</h2><p>水生類 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/origins\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">起源</a>（如人魚種族）將受益於此模組——您現在可以在陸地上行走而不會受到傷害。計時結束後，只需返回水中並重複過程即可。<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1140/968/screenshot-2025-03-27-211934-png.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1140/969/2025-03-27_21-21-11-png.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1140/970/2025-03-27_21-21-36-png.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即獲取伺服器並與好友同樂！點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>或下方橫幅，並使用優惠碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 享75折優惠！</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
